      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I support this feature proposal.\n\nAdditionally, I feel that a significant portion of this issue stems from the loudness of the sounds. The default volume of existing items is very high, which makes this problem more apparent. I believe it would be even better if a toggle for item sounds off were placed in the same location.",
